      "title": "Q1 \u00b7 Is each budget inside its allowance?",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "HEADLINE (sp-zi2hc). Observed spend rate divided by the budget's own fixed allowance (scan_budget_rate_req_per_sec). 1.0 = exactly at budget. GREEN <=1, AMBER 1-2, RED >2. Market and shipyard are separate series and must never be summed - they hold independent allowances (market 0.70 req/s, shipyard 0.12 req/s). A persistently red budget means the fixed allowance is below the fleet's unavoidable pre-buy verification and should be RAISED, never that a money guard should be weakened.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 101,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (budget) (rate(spacetraders_daemon_scan_budget_decisions_total{decision=\"spend\",player_id=\"$player\"}[$__rate_interval]))\n  / max by (budget) (spacetraders_daemon_scan_budget_rate_req_per_sec{player_id=\"$player\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{budget}}"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Budget utilisation (x allowance)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Same ratio as the stat, over time. Dashed threshold lines at 1.0 (at budget) and 2.0 (double budget). The shipyard line falling back toward 1.0 is the signal that a scan-budget fix has landed; a flat line above 2.0 is a persistent structural overdraft.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
